The weakest components of any Home Cinema or HiFi system are typically the loudspeakers/display or the room in which is playing/presented in – This second aspect is often overlooked. Investing in a best in-class AV system doesn’t result in a reference performance, the listening room can have a tremendous effect on the overall presentation. The Frequency and impulse responses are signficantly altered by everything from standing wave patterns to wall reflections. The out of box presentation of your new screen/projector may be oversaturated. The canvas may be entirely out.
The good news is that techological advances coupled with the right tools could help identify, treat and correct any anomolies to provide what we set out to offer – an Epic Home Cinema experience. When buying from us, speak to us about our installation and calibration packages to help get the very best out of your dream system.
