> [H]OT IN HOLLYWOOD in association[ with THE WRITERS GU]ILD[ OF] AMERICA[, WEST] proudly[ announce "]Hollywood Homecoming" to[ be] held on Friday,[ November] 30th from 10AM[ -] 12PM at Sony Studios in Culver City.
